# memory 007 rewrites every frame and copy each draw's vertices instead. Two lines per stats window: "hot pages per
# frame" (pages uploaded, how many are hot = uploaded 3+ frames running, their share of page uploads and upload runs,
# how many pages are hot at once) and "streamed-vertex diagnostic per frame" (draws whose vertex requests hold a hot
# page, the bytes those requests cover vs the bytes the draw's vertices span: index min/max + VGT_INDX_OFFSET times
# the widest stride on that fetch constant, and the time the index scan takes).
